  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the Mandate Implementation of Special Envoy of the Secretary-General on Myanmar</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the development cooperation is to support the mandate delivery of the Special Envoy, with specific focus on building the capacity of the Inclusive Humanitarian Forum (IHF) conveners and associated actors to enable increased humanitarian assistance to the most vulnerable through all channels and save lives. The activities are as follows: 
- Increasing the delivery of humanitarian assistance in Myanmar to the most vulnerable through all channels 
- Strengthening the capacity of Local actors in negotiation and managing skills that can enhance the greater humanitarian access and civilian protection through a variety of channels.
- Providing capacity building support to local actors on community level enhancement in civilian protection</narrative>
  </description>
